title: WaterBalanceR
message: >-
  An R-Package for Estimating Water Balance for Starch
  Potatoes in Germany Based on NDVI Values Provided by
  Sentinel-2, PlanetScope or DJI Phantom 4 Multispectral UAV
type: software
