repository: >-
  https://github.com/thomasp-gfz/WaterBalanceR_JOSS/tree/main
abstract: >
  WaterBalanceR is an open-source R package for estimating
  spatially distributed daily water balance for starch
  potatoes in Germany.  

  It combines NDVI data from UAVs (DJI Phantom 4
  Multispectral) or satellites (PlanetScope, Sentinel-2)
  with meteorological data and irrigation logs to support
  precision irrigation management.
